# The deployed image is Node-only. This repo also holds the Windows Python
# agent (agent.py, agent.spec, requirements.txt), which must never reach the
# server: it is built separately into agent.exe by .github/workflows/build.yml.
#
# Deny everything, then allow back only what the Node backend needs, so a new
# file in the repo cannot end up in the image by accident.
*

!package.json
!package-lock.json
!server.js
!static/
!templates/

# Nothing below is copied by the Dockerfile, but keep it out of the build
# context too so it can never be added by mistake.
**/node_modules/
**/.env
**/*.exe
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
